    "title": "Doral Residents Invited to 2025 State of the City Address on October 23 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "16 hours ago The City of Doral will hold its 2025 State of the City Address on Thursday, October 23, 2025, from 6:30 to 10:00 p.m. The event will be at the Donald J. Trump Grand Ballroom at Trump National Doral, 4400 NW 87th Ave, Doral, FL. Mayor Christi Fraga, City Council members, public servants, and local business leaders will join residents to review the city’s achievements and discuss plans for the next year.\nThe annual event will cover topics such as new parks, community centers, smart-city projects, and business development. The program will include a summary of the past year, announcements of upcoming initiatives, and recognition of individuals and organizations.\nThe event is open to all Doral community members. Sponsors include Downtown Doral, Baptist Health, World Kinect, and others. The evening provides an opportunity for residents and partners to learn about city developments and future plans.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.\n1",
